id: F1
package: fandhe-workshop-web
test: frontend_features
target: Cargo.toml
find: fandhe-frontend-wasm-full = { version = "0.46.0", default-features = false, features = ["action-keydown"] }
replace: fandhe-frontend-wasm-full = { version = "0.46.0", default-features = false, features = [] }
expect-fail: wasm_full_は_既定_feature_なしで_action_keydown_を明示している
note: action-keydown の feature を外す（keydown の配線が黙って登録されなくなる）
